{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07710","headline":"与黄侍御北津泛舟 · 孟浩然","name":"与黄侍御北津泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"津无蛟龙患，日夕常安流。\n本欲避骢马，何如同鷁舟。\n岂伊今日幸，曾是昔年游。\n莫奏琴中鹤，且随波上鸥。\n堤缘九里郭，山面百城楼。\n自顾躬耕者，才非管乐俦。\n闻君荐草泽，从此泛沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}